// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - SCInstructions 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1328583768" "Talos Island briefing"
// DetailString :
"P3314389117" "During the 1950's, the titanic Hero, Talos, fought to save the city from a horrid beast called the Chimera.  Talos wrestled the protean creature into the deepest waters of the bay, and their struggles somehow set off a volcano in the waters.  Talos was killed, and the island created by the lava flow was named after him.  Recently, a couple of gangs have been squaring off for Talos Island turf: the Warriors and the Tsoo.  The Warriors have a fixation with gladiators; they carry swords and are often superb soldiers.  The Tsoo seem to be a gang with some magical might behind them."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2677302743" "The conflict between the Warriors and the Tsoo for dominance over Talos Island is endangering innocents.  The Security Chief over there wants your help."
// AcceptString :
"P4230754683" "Assist the Talos Island Security Chief"
// SendOffString :
"P629059117" "Both those bands of thugs need a lesson, {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL4_Guided_1_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3922672680" "Assist Security Chief"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4164229546" "Talos Island needs your help, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P197124408" "I need you to confront the Tsoo and the Warriors.  Here are some basics about the area.  If I were you, I'd look for the Tsoo in Helen Point or New Sparta.  New Thebes and New Troy are typical Warrior hangouts."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL4_Guided_1_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3408766480" "Discourage gang war"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2050063672" "High powered gang wars have a heavy body count.  Get to work."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P726807929" "You have discouraged the gang war between the Tsoo and the Warriors."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P125760462" "That should quiet things down for a bit.  Talos Island is in for a long war, I'm afraid."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL4_Guided_2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - SCInstructions 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2461205561" "Dark Astoria briefing"
// DetailString :
"P2854764161" "The maps say 'Astoria', but this place has always been 'Dark Astoria' to the people of Paragon City.  The cemetery up there dates back to the prehistoric era, and there's sort of a spooky quality to it.  Of course, very few people go in there anymore - not since the dead started crawling out the ground!  We're pretty sure it's the Banished Pantheon behind it all.  They've got the magic to do it.  You get rid of a few zombies, more come back.  Even worse, there's a giant zombie in there.  That's why the authorities have abandoned the place. <color orange>Heroes should go in there only in small teams.</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3722683267" "I need you to report to the Security Chief for Dark Astoria and help fight the Banished Pantheon.  He didn't give me any details, but he sounded swamped."
// AcceptString :
"P2487186722" "Assist the Dark Astoria Security Chief"
// SendOffString :
"P2036450520" "Dark Astoria can get under your skin, {HeroName}, if you let it.  Just focus on the job at hand."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL4_Guided_2_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1385240948" "Assist the Security Chief"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3932169430" "Dark Astoria isn't pleasant, but they need your help over there."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P548886764" "The Pantheon is causing a lot of trouble around here, especially in Romero Heights and Raimi Arcade.  Take this briefing and get out there."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL4_Guided_2_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1671001835" "Keep peace in Dark Astoria"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1928663723" "Get over to Dark Astoria and deal with the Banished Pantheon!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P628334985" "You have defeated 25 Banished Pantheon cultists."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P678810159" "You seem to have come through that all right.  You have nerves of steel, {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL4_Guided_3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - SCInstructions 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P877607834" "Independence Port briefing"
// DetailString :
"P310489881" "This is where many brave Heroes defended the city against an invading space armada back in the 50's.  Paragon City renamed the area Independence Port, in honor of the Heroes who died in that epic battle.  You'll see the big statue of Cassiopeia by the bridge; she was one of the famous Heroes who died in that fight.  It's a shame that organized crime runs the docks nowadays.  The Family pulls all the strings here, despite the best efforts of law enforcement."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P309378978" "Time to take a bite out of crime, {HeroName}.  The Security Chief in Indy Port wants some help with those scumbags from the Family.  Go lend him a hand."
// AcceptString :
"P3460988851" "Assist the Security Chief in Independence Port"
// SendOffString :
"P1370449512" "If you get a chance take a look at the Statue of Wavelength near the water.  She was a speedster who fell in the Rikti War."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL4_Guided_3_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P241209191" "Help out the Security Chief with those Family goons."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4106772654" "Here's some information on the area.  We've been having a lot of trouble with the Family, especially in Crey Cove and Bell Point.  I really need you to lend a hand."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL4_Guided_3_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2306925908" "Keep peace in Independence Port"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P570047006" "Deal with the Family for the Security Chief."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1263215571" "You have defeated 25 Family thugs."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1397603152" "Nice job helping clean up a historic zone, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL4_Guided_4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Charm 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P4090475707" "Mysterious package"
// DetailString :
"P3462030814" "This package, intended for Stephanie Peebles, has a strange scent.  Try as you might, you can't quite place it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1477503436" "Have you ever been over to Striga Isle, {HeroName}?  There's a woman there named Stephanie Peebles who needs our help.  She's got all she can do trying to hold Port Noble together against the onslaught of the Council. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Will you take this package over to Stephanie?</a> I'd appreciate it if you didn't look inside.  <color orange>Oh, you might want to take some friends.  It can get pretty dicey over there.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P586222097" "Take package to Stephanie Peebles"
// SendOffString :
"P2147070115" "The Council has managed to entrench itself on Striga Isle but good.  If you can give Stephanie any assistance against them, I'm sure she'll be grateful.  Of course, I hope you won't forget about your old friends here in Paragon City.  We'll always be grateful for your help, too."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2703463614" "Go see Stephanie Peebles"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1474934572" "Stephanie's waiting for that package."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBegin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P150715546" "Here's the package.  It's for Stephanie's eyes only."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2265294986" "Thanks for the package, {HeroName}; I'm grateful.  So, what do you think of Port Noble?  Doesn't look like much, maybe?  Well, it's my home.  I've been doing what I can to kick those Council goons out, but I need more help.  I'd appreciate it if you could stick around. <br><br>Otherwise, you can keep following leads from your other contacts.  I'll always be here, and I'll always be grateful for assistance."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - BB_Longbow_Liason_Intro 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4114788318" "I'm sure you've heard about what's going on in Bloody Bay.  Longbow is recruiting Heroes there to fight against the Villains coming in from the Rogue Isles. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Go talk with the Longbow Warzone Liaison for Bloody Bay over in Skyway City.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2646396331" "Speak with Longbow Liaison for Bloody Bay"
// SendOffString :
"P409554809" "The Longbow Liaison will give you an appraisal of the situation in Bloody Bay.  You can then make the choice whether you want to get involved or not."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P784711529" "Speak with Longbow Liaison"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3985600958" "Have you met with the Longbow Liaison yet?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3834945731" "Greetings, {HeroName}.  I'm the Longbow Liaison for the Hero versus Villain PvP zone of Bloody Bay. <color red>Bloody Bay is a Player Vs. Player zone.</color> Bloody Bay is VERY dangerous, and if you go there, you almost certainly will be attacked by other players. <color red>Do not enter Bloody Bay unless you are willing to engage in Player Vs. Player combat.</color><br><br>If you are interested in entering Bloody Bay, you can get there by climbing up to the rooftop of this building via the fire escape and talking with the helicopter pilot. Once you get to Bloody Bay, you can speak with <color orange>Warzone Agent Eckman</color> in the Longbow-controlled safe zone.  She can provide you with missions taking place throughout the zone.  These missions will allow you to change the course of the battle by providing boosts to Heroes or penalties to Villains.  Good Luck!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1783652551" "I hope the Longbow Liaison provided you what you need to know about Bloody Bay."
// RandomFameString :
"P856364347" ""

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - BB_Agent_Brinson_Intro 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P998199679" "I don't know if you realized this, {HeroName}, but as we speak, Paragon City is under assault. Over in Siren's call, Lord Recluse and his men are making every effort to get themselves a foothold. If we let them manage it, we'll be in serious trouble. I'd appreciate it if you'd go speak with Agent Brinson over in Siren's Call. He could use the help of heroes like you. <br><br> <color red>Agent Brinson's tasks will send you into a PVP zone, where you may be killed by other players.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P2071625509" "Talk to Agent Brinson"
// SendOffString :
"P1483765382" "You can get to Siren's Call through Steel Canyon."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3945788825" "Brinson's waiting for you over in Siren's Call."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1255872819" "If you're ready to take on a real challenge, you can be a big help to Longbow here in Siren's Call. We have to push Arachnos out. <color red>Siren's Call is a PVP area. Do not accept my tasks if you are not willing to face villains who are trying to kill you.</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SC_Longbow_Liason_Intro 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P695454443" "I don't know if you realized this, {HeroName}, but as we speak, Paragon City is under assault. Over in Siren's call, Lord Recluse and his men are making every effort to get themselves a foothold. If we let them manage it, we'll be in serious trouble. I'd appreciate it if you'd go speak with the Longbow Warzone Liason over in Steel Canyon. She could use the help of heroes like you. <br><br> <color red>Siren's Call is a PVP zone, where you may be killed by other players.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P897284462" "Talk to Warzone Liason"
// SendOffString :
"P1384391603" "The Warzone Liason can help you get the right contacts in Siren's Call."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P571126852" "The Warzone Liason wants to speak to you about Siren's Call."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3673584871" "If you're ready to take on a real challenge, you can be a big help to Longbow here in Siren's Call. We have to push Arachnos out. If you're willing, you can talk to Agent Brinson. He's got a number of missions that will swing the battle in Longbow's favor. Or you can talk to the Security Chief at the Longbow base; he can tell you all about bounties. <br><br>Siren's Call is a PVP zone. If you enter, you may be killed by other players. Do not enter if you are not willing to risk this."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3467069048" "I hope the Warzone Liason gave you the info you need to help out in Siren's Call. It would be a shame to lose that zone to Arachnos."
